{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_209_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_209","text":"品類足論辯千問品校勘說明","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_209_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_209","text":"一．是書校歷三週．一譯校．二類校．三刻校。","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_209_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_209","text":"二．譯校凡用二種異本。（一）劉宋求那跋陀羅等譯衆事分阿毗曇論．校註略稱宋","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_209_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_209","text":"本。（二）後秦鳩摩羅什譯大智度論初品引文．略稱智論。今譯對勘兩本．文有同","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_209_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_209","text":"異堪資尋討者．悉爲註出曰．某本雲雲。","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_209_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_209","text":"三．類校亦用二本。（一）巴利文本分別論．校註具稱不略。（二）後秦曇摩耶舍等譯","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_209_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_209","text":"舍利弗阿毗曇論．略稱舍利弗。今譯對勘兩本．問答分別〈法門開合詳見篇末附表〉有","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_209_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_209","text":"門同而義異者．悉爲註出曰．某本雲雲。其門義全同者不註。","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_209_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_209","text":"四．刻校用南宋刻爲底本．對校麗刻訂正文字．附註曰．原刻雲雲．今依麗刻雲雲。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_209_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_209","text":"五．校勘資料出處如次。","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_209_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_209","text":"（一）宋譯衆事分阿毗曇論．日本弘教書院縮刷正藏本。","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_209_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_209","text":"（二）秦譯大智度論初品．本院藏要本。","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_209_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_209","text":"（三）巴利文本分別論．Vibhan%ga．達維夫人Mrs.RhysDavids.校刊本．一九","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_209_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_209","text":"○四年．倫敦版。","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_209_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_209","text":"（四）秦譯舍利弗阿毗曇論．日本弘教書院縮刷正藏本。","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_209_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_209","text":"（五）本書南宋刻麗刻．悉依日本弘教書院縮刷正藏本及大正大藏經本之","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_209_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_209","text":"校註。","sortOrder":18}],"overrides":{}}